<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Israel Open on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Scott Draper (Australia) beat Jean-Philippe Fleurian (France) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>6-Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 1-6 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>3-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Ignacio Truyol (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>2-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Lars Jonsson (Sweden) 6-4 1-6 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>7-Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat David Nainkin (South Africa) 6-2 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Marcello Filippini (Uruguay) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 7-6 (7-4) 4-6 7-6 (13-11)</p>
</text>
